    narr:generatedFrom "d60479f4df57bd74c60ef357e16a3ce7cbb09a43" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that fundraising should be run as [a staged process that creates a marketplace rather than chasing individual checks](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_191), with [a time-bound, dated process](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_193) and [a two-call script that opens advice-seeking before announcing the raise](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_197) — the [declared, happening-regardless framing](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_199) that avoids the common failure mode. Sequencing advice runs through [holding a big-name investor back until someone is on the hook](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_183), captured in [the howitzer-and-ammunition metaphor](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_185), because [term sheets are what actually spark investor interest](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_189). The founder's current move is [a bridge round toward enterprise traction before a larger seed](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_102), with [a committed application decision](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_222) and [an offer to forward materials directly](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_177).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_102> ;
